ributes%3Anumber%2Crealm%3Abigint%7D%7D%20JavaScriptCallInstruction%0A%20%2A%2F%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Strict%20functions%20bind%20the%20actual%20receiver%20unchanged.%20Lexical%20functions%20use%0A%20%2A%20their%20captured%20receiver.%20Sloppy%20receiver%20boxing%20and%20arguments%20objects%20need%0A%20%2A%20their%20own%20source%20lowering%2C%20rather%20than%20an%20invented%20frame%20convention.%0A%20%2A%20%40typedef%20%7B%7B%24%3A%27callFunction%27%2Cidentity%3Abigint%2Crealm%3Abigint%2CreceiverMode%3Astring%2C%0A%20%2A%20lexicalReceiver%3AJavaScriptSemanticValue%2Cparameters%3Anumber%2Cregisters%3Anumber%2C%0A%20%2A%20captures%3AJavaScriptSemanticValue%5B%5D%2Cinstructions%3AJavaScriptCallInstruction%5B%5D%7D%7D%20JavaScriptCallFunction%0A%20%2A%2F%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Realm%20identifiers%20are%20supplied%20by%20the%20actual%20intrinsic%20registry.%20Membership%0A%20%2A%20checks%20do%20not%20prove%20authority%20or%20allocate%20a%20substitute%20realm%2FError%20object.%0A%20%2A%20%40typedef%20%7B%7B%24%3A%27callProgram%27%2Cfunctions%3AJavaScriptCallFunction%5B%5D%2Crealms%3Abigint%5B%5D%2CexoticKey%3AJavaScriptSemanticValue%7D%7D%20JavaScriptCallProgram%0A%20%2A%2F%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20value%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20limit%20%40returns%20%7Bboolean%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20testJavaScriptCallCodeCoordinate%28value%2Climit%29%7Breturn%20Number.isSafeInteger%28value%29%26%26value%3E%3D0%26%26value%3Climit%26%26%28value%21%3D%3D0%7C%7C1%2Fvalue%3E0%29%3B%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptCallProgram%7D%20program%20%40param%20%7Bbigint%7D%20identity%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20findJavaScriptCallCodeFunction%28program%2Cidentity%29%7B%0A%20%20let%20low%3D0%2Chigh%3Dprogram.functions.length%3B%0A%20%20while%28low%3Chigh%29%7Bconst%20middle%3DMath.floor%28%28low%2Bhigh%29%2F2%29%2Centry%3Dprogram.functions%5Bmiddle%5D%3Bif%28entry%3D%3D%3Dundefined%29return%20-1%3Bif%28entry.identity%3D%3D%3Didentity%29return%20middle%3B